=2 Walkthrough
!Davoi-map.jpg|right|Davoi Map
* This Mission is Required.

Trade enough {p:Crystals} (1+) to the {p:Conquest NPC} to raise your Rank bar and unlock the Mission.
* Accept the mission **Infiltrate Davoi** from the {n:Gate Guard}.
* Speak to {p:Prince Trion} who can be reached by clicking on the **Door: Prince Royal's Rm** at (G/H-7) of {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} for a cutscene. It is the room on the North side of the court yard.
* Zone into {z:Davoi} for a cutscene.
** {s:Invisible} is recommended for this Mission, bring {@i:Prism Powder|4164} {i:Prism Powders|Prism Powder|4164} or have a spell for Invisiblity.
** Follow the right wall of {z:Jugner Forest} to the zone into {z:Davoi} at (G-12).
** A map of {z:Davoi} can be purchased for 3,000 {p:Gil} from {n:Elesca} at I-8 of {z:Northern San d'Oria} or {n:Violitte} at G-10 of {z:Southern San d'Oria}.
* Speak with {n:Quemaricond}, patrolling around (H-7), when it is safe to drop Invisibility. You will obtain {@k}{k:Royal Knights' Davoi report}.
* Return to {p:Prince Trion} to complete the Mission.

=2 Repeating the Mission
* If you have already completed this Mission and wish to repeat it, your objective will be different:
* Talk to any Gate Guard and accept the Mission.
** There are two in {z:Southern San d'Oria}, {n:Ambrotien} at (K-6) and {n:Endracion} at (F-9). There is also a gate guard in {z:Northern San d'Oria}, {n:Grilau} at (D-8).
* Make your way to {z:Davoi}. Zone into {z:Jugner Forest} from {z:La Theine Plateau} at (M-8). Then follow the right wall of {z:Jugner Forest} to the zone into {z:Davoi} at (G-12).
* When you enter {z:Davoi}, speak with {n:Zantaviat} the NPC near the tree.
* You will need to find 3 targetable **!** marks and check them.
** The first one is at the north side of (K-7) to obtain {@k} {k:East Block code}.
** The second is at (L-8) to obtain {@k} {k:South Block code}.
** The third is at the north-west corner of (J-7) to obtain {@k} {k:North Block code}.
* Return to {n:Zantaviat} then return to the {n:Gate Guard}.

